    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S01-P01",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "解释总是经过选择",
      "text": "任何解释都会选择一组变量、时间窗口和因果关系。选择本身并非错误；没有选择，人无法在有限注意力中工作。问题在于，当选择过程被隐藏，解释容易显得比它实际覆盖的现实更完整。",
      "sequence": 1,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S01-P02",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "解释总是经过选择",
      "text": "同一个结果可以同时属于多个尺度。一次延误可能与一个动作有关，也可能与资源配置、依赖关系或环境变化有关。只在一个尺度上成立的解释，不能自动代表整个现实。",
      "sequence": 2,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S02-P01",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "理解需要保留边界与未知",
      "text": "现实理解不仅问“哪个故事最顺”，还问：证据来自哪里，哪些观察缺失，哪些关系只是相关，哪些条件改变后结论会失效。它把未知保留在结构中，而不是用语言流畅度把未知覆盖掉。",
      "sequence": 101,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S02-P02",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "理解需要保留边界与未知",
      "text": "因此，理解通常包含多个并存层：可观察事实、基于事实的解释、尚待验证的假设，以及无法由当前证据判断的部分。不同层级不能互相冒充。",
      "sequence": 102,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S03-P01",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "从结果叙述到现实定位",
      "text": "更稳健的过程可以从观察开始：先记录发生了什么，再核对证据与时间顺序，补充相关背景，提出一个或多个解释，标记不确定性，最后说明如何继续验证。",
      "sequence": 201,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S03-P02",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "从结果叙述到现实定位",
      "text": "这个过程常常比直接给出结论更慢，却能减少系统层级错位：局部现象不会被轻易升级为整体规律，短期变化也不会被误写成稳定身份。",
      "sequence": 202,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S04-P01",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "理解是一项持续活动",
      "text": "现实会变化，证据会增加，原有模型也可能失效。理解因此不是一次性获得的状态，而是一项能够被更新的活动。",
      "sequence": 301,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
        "证据选择",
        "适用边界"
      ],
      "aliases": []
    },
    {
      "fragmentCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE-S04-P02",
      "nodeCode": "KN-PREFACE-010",
      "articleCode": "KA-PREFACE-010-ZH-ARTICLE",
      "locale": "zh-Hans",
      "heading": "理解是一项持续活动",
      "text": "好的解释仍然有价值，但它应当携带来源、范围、反例与复核条件。只有这样，解释才能成为导航的一部分，而不是导航的终点。",
      "sequence": 302,
      "fragmentType": "article_paragraph",
      "publicStatus": "published",
      "claimCodes": [],
      "sourceCodes": [
        "SRC-PREFACE-S07"
      ],
      "themeCode": "TH-PREFACE-05",
      "collectionCode": "KC-PREFACE",
      "previousNode": "KN-PREFACE-005",
      "nextNode": "KN-PREFACE-011",
      "relatedNodes": [
        "KN-PREFACE-004",
        "KN-PREFACE-011",
        "KN-PREFACE-013"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "替代解释",
        "解释模型",
